business? Well let me throw out just a few of the things we're thinking<br />
about here at SOE.<br />
<br />
What if you could have families in MMO's? Virtual Children... What if<br />
your characters could have children and pass on the family name.....<br />
<br />
What if players could build fantastic dungeons that become part of the<br />
worlds we create with tools we give them? How would that work exactly? <br />
<br />
Can MMORPGs have skill-based combat?<br />
<br />
What if?<br />
<br />
I mention these things to be provocative. I want to make sure we're<br />
going to take what we do to the next level... and that's going to mean<br />
putting some next generation ideas out there and seeing the kinds of<br />
things you actually want... but I at least want to start this dialogue<br />
and stir the pot a little. We're very interested in your ideas about<br />
where things go from here. <br />
<br />
John Smedley<br />
President, Sony Online Entertainment</td>
 </tr>
